# /sdd-status

Description:
  Show current execution status: token usage, decisions, tasks, and
  pending approvals.

Usage:
  /sdd-status
  /sdd-status --tokens
  /sdd-status --decisions

Options:
  --tokens     Show detailed token usage per stage
  --decisions  Show decision status

Output:
  Markdown table: stage, tokens used, status, next step.

State: +